{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TIME TO PICK UP YOUR BOWS AND 1 ARROW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, maybe if it weren't for the circumstances in which you find yourselves, these challenges would be easy to solve, but now you have to rely on each other because of the curse of the Sorcerer who took away your most valuable possessions! Your arrows! Now you have to share 1 cursed arrow for you 2...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/1d64c081314f114418ba02d6a4a11a58.poster.avif?t=1774272812\" width=1170 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/1d64c081314f114418ba02d6a4a11a58.webm?t=1774272812\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/1d64c081314f114418ba02d6a4a11a58.mp4?t=1774272812\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>THE GAME IS FOR 2 PLAYERS ONLY!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can't play 1 or if there are 3 or more, you get the idea.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/5baf1ebe08c11d3e7c34b244ae43d08d.avif?t=1774272812\" width=591 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Bows 1 Arrow is a \u0441oop action puzzle platforming about your adventure with unique shooting mechanic that allows each player to shoot ONLY after each other. Each level offers a new challenge, whether it's your coordination, intelligence, communication, or just your ability to shoot a bow accurately - usually accompanied by unique mechanic, like non-stop running through obstacles or even rhythm game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and yet it would be much easier if the Sorcerer hadn't left you with one cursed arrow in front of his bizzare, multi-biome, target-filled castle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/2d632f6503501bb7127d426ebce0ceb8.avif?t=1774272812\" width=591 height=76 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We offer you (for now):</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/295699d8f7fc3ee1d06fba4e2b5415ce.avif?t=1774272812\" width=1560 height=614 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4 DIFFERENTLY THEMED LOCATIONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3825740/extras/0ff8323ab4a4dd584cdb40686e6d3db6.avif?t=1774272812\" width=1560 height=614 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 unique soundtracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 secret levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Logic puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting with the Sorcerer's minions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-operative 3D platform jumping</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bows</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 arrow</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TO BE ADDED</strong></h2></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More information can be found in Roadmap section. In two words, more levels.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Is started\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3825740/613c0eec43fde90e981350250c7eca180413ffa4.jpg"},{"name":"Hit and RUN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam